     "has_translation": null,
     "text": "It’s so easy to slip into the roommate phase when you give all of your energy to your kids, work, and life. By the end of the day, you collapse into bed, watch an Office episode, fall asleep, wake up, and do it all over again. \n\nThis year has been one of the hardest years of my life. We struggled with some health scares, and navigating some of the deepest depression and anxiety I’ve ever had. We finally launched @drinksteamy after 3 years of working on it. We’ve had some insane highs and insane lows.\n\nBut when I zoom out from all the stress and noise of life, I see the man I’ve built my life with. The man I’ve spent a third of my life with. The father of our children. And I fall in love with him all over again.\n\nHe’s still the person I want to laugh with, tell everything to, and come home to at the end of the day. He’s my best friend, my safe place, and the love of my life.\n\nI’m so grateful for you @chriswilllly🩷\n\n(Photos by the amazing @aubreebellephotography 🥹)",
